{
  "sequence_id": "seq_fb6d15ad78b7191c",
  "texts": [
    {
      "id": "PG1:T1",
      "page": 1,
      "text": "No way...that's absurd..."
    },
    {
      "id": "PG1:T2",
      "page": 1,
      "text": "And also,"
    },
    {
      "id": "PG1:T3",
      "page": 1,
      "text": "You have a message from special class Arima."
    },
    {
      "id": "PG1:T4",
      "page": 1,
      "text": "He said \"I will be returning the book I borrowed, so tell me a convenient time.\""
    },
    {
      "id": "PG1:T5",
      "page": 1,
      "text": "....though it's fine not to do it personally,"
    },
    {
      "id": "PG1:T6",
      "page": 1,
      "text": "Since we're all busy."
    },
    {
      "id": "PG1:T7",
      "page": 1,
      "text": "Jeez, is he being conscience- Tious, or NANT..."
    },
    {
      "id": "PG1:T8",
      "page": 1,
      "text": "Ah, that \"Nant\" can have another \"NAN\" in it..."
    },
    {
      "id": "PG1:T9",
      "page": 1,
      "text": "I get it. SHUT UP."
    },
    {
      "id": "PG1:T10",
      "page": 1,
      "text": "He wants to meet you after such a long while, doesn't he?"
    },
    {
      "id": "PG1:T11",
      "page": 1,
      "text": "It's like a \"parental Love\"."
    },
    {
      "id": "PG1:T12",
      "page": 1,
      "text": "I wonder if that guy has that sort of feeling..."
    },
    {
      "id": "PG1:T13",
      "page": 1,
      "text": "who knows."
    },
    {
      "id": "PG1:T14",
      "page": 1,
      "text": "I'll try going over there when the investigation claims down."
    },
    {
      "id": "PG1:T15",
      "page": 1,
      "text": "SASAKI,"
    },
    {
      "id": "PG1:T16",
      "page": 1,
      "text": "?."
    },
    {
      "id": "PG2:T1",
      "page": 2,
      "text": "The true power which has received the white wing medal is not just for show."
    },
    {
      "id": "PG2:T2",
      "page": 2,
      "text": "I am also hoping you'll be the Mado Squad's Ace."
    },
    {
      "id": "PG2:T3",
      "page": 2,
      "text": "Strive for that, rank 1 SASAKI."
    },
    {
      "id": "PG2:T4",
      "page": 2,
      "text": "Akira- San..."
    },
    {
      "id": "PG2:T5",
      "page": 2,
      "text": "How about I strive for a hug?"
    },
    {
      "id": "PG2:T6",
      "page": 2,
      "text": "NO. Harry up and go."
    },
    {
      "id": "PG2:T7",
      "page": 2,
      "text": "\"Surpass Arima-San\"... Huh?"
    },
    {
      "id": "PG2:T8",
      "page": 2,
      "text": "SENSE!!"
    },
    {
      "id": "PG3:T1",
      "page": 3,
      "text": "Ah, Mutsuki- KUN."
    },
    {
      "id": "PG3:T2",
      "page": 3,
      "text": "Good work today!"
    },
    {
      "id": "PG3:T3",
      "page": 3,
      "text": "Did you drop by Shiba- Sensei's place?"
    },
    {
      "id": "PG3:T4",
      "page": 3,
      "text": "Yeah."
    },
    {
      "id": "PG3:T5",
      "page": 3,
      "text": "My anemia was acting up again..."
    },
    {
      "id": "PG3:T6",
      "page": 3,
      "text": "How did your investigation go?"
    },
    {
      "id": "PG3:T7",
      "page": 3,
      "text": "Ah, oh yeah."
    },
    {
      "id": "PG3:T8",
      "page": 3,
      "text": "There was an incident of \"growing sounds of a beast\" being heard from the neighborhood."
    },
    {
      "id": "PG3:T9",
      "page": 3,
      "text": "and the lady was worried that \"it might be a ghoul\"...\"..."
    },
    {
      "id": "PG3:T10",
      "page": 3,
      "text": "But, as a result of rank 3 yone- Bayashi and I investigating around the area,"
    },
    {
      "id": "PG3:T11",
      "page": 3,
      "text": "We ascertained that in truth it was just a stray dog,"
    },
    {
      "id": "PG3:T12",
      "page": 3,
      "text": "GRRGRGRGRGRGRGRGRGRGRGRGRGRGRGRGRGRGRGRGRGR."
    },
    {
      "id": "PG3:T13",
      "page": 3,
      "text": "that had made the neighbor- hood its home, growling behind the lady's house."
    },
    {
      "id": "PG3:T14",
      "page": 3,
      "text": "briskly"
    },
    {
      "id": "PG3:T15",
      "page": 3,
      "text": "Gkrr- Rrrrrrrrrrrrrrrrrrrrrrrrrrrrrrrrrrrrrrrrrrrrrrrrrrrrrr"
    },
    {
      "id": "PG3:T16",
      "page": 3,
      "text": "So it was just a beast."
    },
    {
      "id": "PG3:T17",
      "page": 3,
      "text": "BARK BARK BARK BARK BARK BARK BARK BARK BARK BARK BARK BARK BARK BARK BARK"
    },
    {
      "id": "PG3:T18",
      "page": 3,
      "text": "When we informed the lady of that she said \"from today on, I'll be able to sleep soundly\""
    },
    {
      "id": "PG3:T19",
      "page": 3,
      "text": "And was extremely relieved."
    },
    {
      "id": "PG3:T20",
      "page": 3,
      "text": "I see, I see..."
    }
  ],
